      <activity id="3149fba1-bccf-59dd-8a37-5bdf4703ca56" activityNameId="8a6ab1bf-e1f1-576e-a044-6e36aa198f3a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Selective coating, stainless steel sheet, black chrome</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Selective coating, stainless steel sheet, black chrome
Inventory for selective coatings of solar absorbers. For black chrome and black nickel the solar absorbance is a=0.91~0.98 and thermal emittance is e=0.06~0.14.;
UUID: 4e08848a-c967-3117-a2c7-8f7b097247f8
Gate to gate inventory for the process including infrastructure. No information for waste and packages.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Black chrome coating. The main process stages used for the process are: Cleaning with electrolytic wash bath at ambient temperature (20°C), Activation, Black coating at ambient temperature (20°C), Recuperation baths, Reduction bath
Time period: Environmental report.
Production volume: Data for one company.
Sampling: Personal communication. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4e08848a-c967-3117-a2c7-8f7b097247f8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
